abstract: "Frozen execution code, experimental manifests and descriptive result exports for a 1472-trial simulated-quadruped evaluation separating local fault response from language-model scheduling. The raw evidence for main_001 is not included and its public deposit is pending. Historical 360-trial data are not part of the current tree and are not pooled with these results."
keywords:
  - robotics
  - quadruped simulation
  - local reflex
  - language-model scheduling
  - reproducibility
